# .dev.vars — local secrets for wrangler dev
# Copy this to .dev.vars (which is gitignored) and fill in your values.
#
# .dev.vars is loaded automatically by `wrangler dev` and provides
# environment variables to your Worker at runtime.
#
# For local development, you DON'T need any of these — wrangler dev
# uses a local simulator for D1, KV, and auth. These are only needed
# for `wrangler deploy` to the real Cloudflare account.
#
# Format: KEY=value (one per line, no quotes needed for simple values)

# Cloudflare API token (Account → Workers R2 D1 → Edit)
# Get from: https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
# Required scopes: Account.Workers Scripts:Edit, Account.D1:Edit
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=cfat_your_token_here

# Cloudflare Account ID (right sidebar on Cloudflare dashboard)
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=your_account_id_here

# Optional: GitHub PAT for auto-pushing to origin during deploy
# TIMEANDDATEPRO_PAT=ghp_your_pat_here
